{"server":"jp","storyId":"act12d0_level_act12d0_ex01_end","groupId":"act12d0","stageId":"act12d0_ex01","title":"東に声して西を撃つ","storyCode":"RI-EX-1","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_ex01_end.txt","sourceHash":"146ce16372f5c50ea4b806b7821f0eca2bb9bc5aae35f2c4743a95996ab00ee5","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"烈日、荒野、黄砂、熱風！　よっしゃー！　新曲が心の底から湧き上がってくるぜー！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"（solo）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"二人ともうるさいよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"そうよ。せっかくこんな広くて誰もいない場所なのよ。追われる心配もないんだし、少しは静かに休んだらどう？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"でもAlty、ここでも海の匂いがするよ。本当に安全なの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Ayaは相変わらず夢がないわね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"この大地に安全な場所なんてないわ。でも私たちだって、たまにはリラックスしなきゃ。そうでしょ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"そうかもしれないけどさ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"それで、次はどうやって道を拓くの？　手ぶらで帰るわけにもいかないでしょ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"今回は、あの医者が答えをくれたわ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Altyは手に握った「鍵」を見やった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"おいおいマジか？　そりゃどー見ても普通の代物には見えねーんだけど、ホントに貰ったのか？　何かと交換したのか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"ええ、知識とね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"知識とそいつで、釣り合いが取れんの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"さあね。でもあの医者はまるで、私たちにその知識を駆使するよう促してるみたいだったわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"知識って、あの人が知らないこと？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"いいえ、私たちが知ってることなら、恐らく彼女も……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"……そうね。よくよく考えてみれば、今回の取引で彼女は、好奇心を利用することで私たちを動かしたのかもしれない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"つまり、アイツは実質何も差し出してねーってこと？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"うん……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"そうなるわね……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"騙されたね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"いいえ、誘導されたと言ったほうが正しいわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"操られたってことじゃねーの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"導かれた。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"あの医者って、そんなに重要な人なの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"いいえ。あの医者が伝えたかったのはまさにそれだと思うわ。彼女の言動は重要じゃないということをね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"そう、重要なのは、私たちがどう考えて、どう動くか……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"じゃあ鍵はどうするの？　放っておく？　それともやっぱり行く？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"めんどくせーよ。行かなきゃダメか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"これって音楽と同じだと思うわ……私たちは、他人を無理やり変えてしまうほどの力を持つべきじゃないの。ただ自分たちの歌を歌うだけでいい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"みんなに歌を聴かせて、それがいい歌なら――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"人々も歌ってくれるってやつか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"（solo）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"はぁ。じゃあさらなる知識とこの鍵を、準備が整った人に渡してあげましょ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"それって誰になるの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"わからないわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"まだ生まれてきてないのかもね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"そりゃーいいな！　まだ生まれてないでくれよー！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"そんなこと期待しないで、Dan。私たちはね……あら？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"どうしたの、Alty。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"車のエネルギーが切れたわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"ちゃんと準備してなかったの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"してたわよ。だけど寄り道しちゃったでしょ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"それに正直に言うと、こういう公道も標識もない荒野をずっと運転してると、簡単に方向感覚がなくなっちゃうのよね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"それって私たち、迷子になっちゃったってこと？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"そうは言いきれないわ。おおよその方向は合ってるだろうし、新たな道を切り拓いていると言うべきね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"迷子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"迷子！　いいネタになるねぇ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"あーあ。Danのポジティブさは時々本気で見習いたくなるよ。それで、これからどうするの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"向こうにジャングルがあるみたいだから、行ってみましょう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"それはいいんだけど、誰が車を推すの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"順番に推すのもいいかもしれないわね。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Alty。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"なにかしら。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"周りに人がたくさん集まってきてるよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"そうね。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"でも、何言ってるかわからないわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"だからって、ついてくるのをこのまま放っとくの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"何かアイデアでもあるの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"全部やっつけちゃったら？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"あなたがFrostとDanを説得できるならね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"（弾き歌い）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"&*……%￥……&（なんだこの音！　すげえいい響きだな！？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"&%……%（こんなすごい音、聞いたことない……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"よう！　みんな！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"何喋ってるかアタシにも教えてくれねー？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"あっ、教えてくれても聞き取れねーか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"……%&￥（この人たち、どこから来たの！？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人D","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"￥……&#（こいつ、すげぇ変な恰好してんなぁ！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"ま、いっか。少なくともここは、無人地帯じゃないみたいだね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"どこか補給できる場所があればいいんだけど。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Alty、そんな夢みたいなこと言わないで。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"お前たち、異郷人か？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"あら？　あなたが話してるのってサルゴン語？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"ふむ、確かに異郷人のようだな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"ここに何の用だ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"私たちの車、エネルギー切れしちゃったの。だから補給させてほしいと思ってね。アーツがわかる人はいるかしら？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"……ついてこい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"ほらね、Aya。希望が見えたわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"へぇ、ホントこの大地って不思議がいっぱい。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"おいおいおい、おいおいおいおいおい、なんだよこれ、いったいどういうことなんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"どっからどー見ても原始的なジャングルに、こんな村があんのか！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"（鼻歌）～♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"確かにびっくりだね。どの建物も現代建築の面影がありながら、原始的な美しさを残してる。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"変だけど、ユニークね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"私はこの部族の族長、ズゥママだ。この部族では大半の者が、お前たちの言葉を理解できる。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"部族の祭司たちに車のエネルギーを補給させてやってもいいが、一つ条件がある。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"なに？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"車の内部構造が見たい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"……それだけでいいの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"車を壊さないって保証はあるの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"壊さない。たぶん。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Alty?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"背に腹は代えられないわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"それでどうなんだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"取引成立よ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"わかった。じいや。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"なんじゃ！　……ん？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"むむむ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"お前さんたちは……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"あなたは……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"まさかこんなところで、あなたみたいな存在と出会えるなんてね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"ふむ、正直に言うと、わしも同じことを思ったぞ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"じゃがわしは、お前さんたちより、お前さんたちの車のほうに興味があるぞい！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"それじゃ、お好きにどうぞ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"さっきも言ったけど、ホントこの大地って不思議がいっぱいだね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"珍しく同意見よ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一方、Frostはギターを祭祀用のスピーカーに繋ぎ、即興のソロを演奏し始めた。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"いい曲ね、Frost。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"この不思議な村から、インスピレーションを貰った。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"イケてんねー、Frost。メロディーに変化を取り入れてみたんだな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"灼熱、抑圧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"この曲の名前は……『D』！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"なんだこの音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一体なんの音なんだ？　全身から力が湧いてくるぜ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"さっき来た異郷人たちがやってるみたいだ！　見に行こうぜ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"人がどんどん集まって来たよ、Alty……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"まずいわね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"生命たちが渇望してる！　音楽を！　力を！　そして……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"この音は！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"なぁ異郷人、もっと音を残していってくれ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Alty……この雰囲気良くない？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"いっそのこと、私たちのスピーカーも運び出してさ、一曲演奏してあげようよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"反対はしないわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"いいじゃんいいじゃん！　こんなサイッコーのアレンジを聞かされたら、アタシだって我慢できねぇーよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Frostだけにいい恰好はさせねーぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"そうね。ここの人たちに、AUSの音楽を感じてもらいましょう！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ただ変な音が並んでるだけなのに、興奮が止まんねぇ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"まさかこれも祭司たちが使ってる祭楽と同じ、「楽曲」ってやつなのか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"こんな楽曲、今まで聞いたことねぇ！　あいつらは一体何モンだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人D","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"わかった、きっとあいつらは「クイカヨーティ」なんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"「クイカヨーティ」？　なんだそれー？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"ふむ、彼らの言語で「歌う人」という意味じゃ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"ここは長きに渡って「クイカヨーティ」が不在じゃったからのう。お前さんたちの音楽が、皆の心を完全に虜にしてしまったんじゃ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"まあ正直に言ってしまうと、お前さんたちの音楽は、わしが昔に聞いた「クイカヨーティ」とはまったく違うがの！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"じゃが大丈夫じゃ、お前さんたちの音楽の方が面白い！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人E","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"「クイカヨーティ」、もう一曲聞かせてくれ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アダクリス人F","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欲しいものは全部やるから、どうかもう一曲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Alty、どうするの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"しばらく残ろうぜー、Alty！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"私たちの目的を忘れないでって言いたいけれど……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"まあいいわ、時間はたっぷりあるし。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"こんなところにもトランスポーターがいるんだね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"イナム","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"そっちこそ……雑誌でしか見たことないAUSがここに来るとは思わなかったわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"ズゥママは？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"イナム","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"あんたたちが使いたいって言ってたスピーカーを作ってる。代わりに私が道案内をしてあげるわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"イナム","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"ここにはどのくらい滞在するつもり？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"一週間、ううん、一ヶ月。いや、もしかしたら一年になるかもしれないわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"すっかりこの場所に焚き付けられちゃったの。だから、最後まで楽しまないとね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"イナム","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"だったら、ライブをするのに最適な場所があるわ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_temple_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"イカした場所じゃねーか！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"ここは……霊殿かしら？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"イナム","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"そうよ。昔は全部族がここに集まって「マヒゾッティア」を開いていたの。だけど、ガヴィルが出て行ってから、もう長い間使われていないわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"「マヒゾッティア」？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"それに、ガヴィルですって？　ロドスでも同じ名前を見たような気がするけど……まあきっと、同じ名前の別人でしょう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"イナム","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"ここで演奏すればいいわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"最高の音楽を、ここの人たちに楽しんでもらおう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"ハハ、そうだな。ここにAUSの痕跡を残してくっきゃねーな！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"二ヶ月後"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"イナム","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"AUSって本当に不思議な人たちね……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"イナム","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"まさか二ヶ月もここに滞在するなんて。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"イナム","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"いつかガヴィルが帰ってきたら、驚くでしょうね。こんな辺鄙な場所に、音楽の概念が生まれたことに。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"イナム","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"そしてここの人たちが、ロックに心酔してしまったことに。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"イナム","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"さてさて、今日はどんな演奏をしてくれるのかしら？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"イナム","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"……一番夢中になってるのは、私自身なのかもね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"イナム","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"AUSのみんな、今日は……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"イナム","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"あれ？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"部屋には誰もいなかった。生活用品や寝具はきれいに片づけられ、部屋のテーブルの上には、一枚の紙が置かれている。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"イナム","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"まさか、出て行っちゃったの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"イナム","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"これは手紙かしら、ええっと……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"イナム","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"「もう行くわ、さようなら。どうかお構いなく。音楽があなたたちに喜びをもたらしてくれますように。私たちのアルバムは全部ここに残していくから、心ゆくまで楽しんで。――AUS」"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"イナム","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"……ふふ、本当に不思議な人たちね。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"私はあのアカフラって場所をきっと忘れないわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"（鼻歌）～♪　忘れられない経験。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"でもあの人たち、うるさくて乱暴だったじゃない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"そうか？　アタシゃー気に入ったぜ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"あんた、あそこに残っても上手くやっていけそうだったもんね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"まーな。出てくるのだってすげー迷ったし。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"あそこのヤツらってさー、天然っていうか、原始的な活力に満ちてる感じがしねー？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"今までいろんな国や都市を回ってきたけど、こんなヤツらに会ったのは初めてだろ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"だからアタシも気に入ったんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"そうね、それは否定できないわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"みんな私たちの音楽を理解してくれた。みんな最高の観客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Frostも気に入ってるみたいね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"だけど、やっぱり他人の生活をめちゃくちゃにするのは良くないことよ。私たちはただ歌を歌うだけでいいわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"みんなに歌を聴かせて、それがいい歌なら――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"人々も歌ってくれるってやつか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"あれ、前にも同じことを言わなかったっけ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"さあね。もしかしたら何度も言っているのかもしれないわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"さあ、私たちの旅を続けましょう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"私たちの歌に、大地は耳を傾けてくれるかしら？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"車に揺られながら、彼女たちは冗談で話題を締めくくった。\n手に握った鍵を見て、Altyは思う。ねえケルシー先生、あなたたちロドスは、この大地が求める答えを出せるのかしら？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_416_zumama","aliases":["ユーネクテス"]}]}
